**`txtar/archive.go`** — `Lookup` method:
```go
// Lookup returns the file with the given name, or nil and false
// when the archive has no such file.
func (a *Archive) Lookup(name string) (*File, bool) {
	for i, f := range a.Files {
		if f.Name == name {
			return &a.Files[i], true
		}
	}
	return nil, false
}
```

**`txtar/archive_test.go`** — `TestLookup` with two cases: one verifying a found file returns the correct `*File` and `true`, and one verifying a missing file returns `nil` and `false`.

